# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Starter app for **North Embedded Checkout** (Express + TypeScript), generated by `north-skills`.

```bash
npm install
# put your Sandbox credentials in .env
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000, add items, click **Checkout**, and pay with North's Sandbox test card:

| Card | Expiry | CVV | ZIP |
|------|--------|-----|-----|
| `4111 1111 1111 1111` (Visa) | any future date, e.g. `12/30` | any 3 digits, e.g. `123` | any 5 digits, e.g. `12345` |
| `3700 000000 00002` (Amex) | any future date | any 4 digits | any 5 digits |

Sandbox payments are mock requests: nothing is charged.

| File | Job |
|------|-----|
| `src/north/client.ts` | The only code that calls North (create session, session status) |
| `src/north/router.ts` | `/api/north/session`, `/api/north/verify`, `/api/webhooks/north/transaction` |
| `src/north/payment.ts` | Decides "paid in full" (status + `auth_resp` + `auth_amount`) |
| `src/north/webhook.ts` | Verifies the transaction webhook HMAC over raw bytes |
| `public/north-checkout.js` | Mounts North's hosted form, then verifies on the confirm page |

Going further: ask your agent `/north-embedded-checkout <what you want>` or `/learn-north`.

**Before production:** replace the in-memory store in `src/north/orders.ts` with a database, set the Checkout Designer Domain to your site's origin, and ask North to allowlist your webhook URL.
